#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Select recipients using filters like Members, Prospects, or Event Attendees."
msgstr ""
"Pilih penerima menggunakan filter seperti Anggota, Prospek, atau Peserta "
"Acara."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Send <strong>professional offers</strong> for meeting room packages, private "
"offices, or custom services."
msgstr ""
"Kirim <strong>penawaran profesional</strong> untuk paket ruangan meeting, "
"kantor pribadi, atau layanan khusus."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Send members the new Wi-Fi code, upcoming events, and important updates via "
"<strong>Email Marketing</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Kirimkan kode Wi-Fi baru, acara mendatang, dan pembaruan penting kepada "
"anggota melalui <strong>Email Marketing</strong>."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Send or schedule your email and track opens and clicks."
msgstr "Kirim atau jadwalkan email dan lacak jumlah buka dan klik."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Send quotes and invoices automatically."
msgstr "Kirim penawaran dan faktur secara otomatis."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Set a Loyalty Rule to give <strong>10 points</strong> when the product is "
"purchased."
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan Aturan Loyalitas untuk memberikan <strong>10 poin</strong> saat "
"produk dibeli."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Set a Reward where <strong>1 point = 100% discount on 1 coworking day</"
"strong>.<br/>\n"
"                        → As the client books coworking days, they apply "
"their points at checkout. Once all 10 points are used, the standard day "
"price applies for future bookings."
msgstr ""
"Atur Hadiah dengan ketentuan <strong>1 poin = diskon 100% untuk 1 hari "
"coworking</strong>.<br/>\n"
"                        → Saat memesan hari coworking, klien akan "
"menggunakan poinnya saat checkout. Setelah semua 10 poin terpakai, harga "
"harian standar berlaku untuk pemesanan selanjutnya."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Set the product type to <strong>Service – Membership / Partnership</strong> "
"for subscription offers (Business Address and Unlimited monthly access)."
msgstr ""
"Atur tipe produk ke <strong>Layanan – Keanggotaan / Kemitraan</strong> untuk "
"tawaran langganan (Alamat Bisnis dan Akses bulanan tanpa batas)."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Set time slots, ticket types, and attendance limits if needed."
msgstr "Tentukan slot waktu, jenis tiket, dan batas jumlah peserta bila perlu."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Share event links via email or social media so members and guests can sign "
"up easily."
msgstr ""
"Bagikan tautan acara melalui email atau media sosial agar anggota dan tamu "
"dapat mendaftar dengan mudah."

