msgid ""
"Switch tiers whenever your month changes shape. We prorate the difference on "
"your next invoice, so moving from Flex to Resident mid-month only charges "
"the days you actually upgrade."
msgstr ""

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Tag opportunities by interest type (e.g., “Day Pass,” “Private Office”) for "
"better reporting."
msgstr ""
"Tandai peluang dengan tag berdasarkan jenis kepentingannya (misalnya “Pass "
"Harian”, “Kantor Pribadi”) untuk pelaporan yang lebih baik."

