#: model:event.event,subtitle:coworking.website_event_event_4
msgid "Talk"
msgstr ""

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:event.event,description:coworking.website_event_event_3
msgid ""
"The month's easiest introduction. We clock off in the golden hour, pour "
"something cold, and let conversations happen on their own — no name tags, no "
"pitching, just the people who happen to share the floor. Friends and would-"
"be members welcome."
msgstr ""

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This suite of applications is designed to meet the needs of coworking "
"spaces; whether you manage a boutique shared office, a multi-location "
"coworking hub, or a community-driven workspace. With Odoo, you can "
"centralize your operations in\n"
"            one place: from selling memberships and booking meeting rooms to "
"engaging your community and organizing staff schedules."
msgstr ""
"Rangkaian aplikasi ini dirancang untuk memenuhi kebutuhan coworking space; "
"baik untuk kantor berskala kecil, hub coworking dengan banyak lokasi, maupun "
"ruang kerja berbasis komunitas. Dengan Odoo, Anda dapat memusatkan kegiatan "
"operasional di\n"
"            satu tempat: dari menjual keanggotaan dan memesan ruangan "
"meeting hingga melibatkan komunitas serta mengatur jadwal staf."

#. module: coworking
#: model:crm.stage,name:coworking.crm_stage_5
msgid "Tour scheduled"
msgstr "Tur dijadwalkan"

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Track and schedule repairs for equipment like printers, or coffee machines "
"with <strong>Maintenance</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Lacak dan jadwalkan perbaikan untuk peralatan seperti printer atau mesin "
"kopi dengan <strong>Maintenance</strong>."

